# source     : the committed references pointed at `${KICAD9_3DMODEL_DIR}/Connector_Coaxial.3dshapes/U.FL_Molex_MCRF_73412-0110_Vertical.step`, which the installed package does not ship, so all four were unresolved.
# note       : the 2.6 x 2.6 F.Fab figure is the jack's PAD-LAND envelope on the board; the physical connector body is taller and narrower than its land pattern, so this model over-states the body footprint in X/Y -- deliberately, because a spatial review should see the land it must keep clear, and under-stating it would hide a collision.
# note       : four separate RF ports, one per antenna path; the census resolves all four through this one model.
